						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Wednesday, November 27, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">The Bastards are coming </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Greetings Solusek Ro, a new guild is coming to your server that goes by the name of 'Bastards'.<BR><BR>Now, we'll be honest with you.  This is a novelty guild for now, for obvious reasons.  But if like us, you find it amusing if not slightly childish, and would be interested in joining.  Come and visit us at:  <BR>http://www.geocities.com/scurveypestilential/main.html<BR><BR>Maybe if some right minded thinking people join, we will take the guild to the next level and become a raiding and grouping guild.<BR><BR>No promises are made for now except one, it'll be quite funny.<BR><BR>- Scurvy Pestilential
							<br><BR>
							 - Scurvy<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=339">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
